Scenario: Move Folder Bookmark To Folder
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	When BookmarksFolder add PG
		|folderDescription|Test Folder Description 1|
		|folderName|Test Folder Name 1|
	And BookmarksFolder goto PG
		|folderName|Test Folder Name 1|
	And Bookmark add PG
		|bookmarkDescription|Test Bookmark Description|
		|bookmarkName|Test Bookmark Name|
		|bookmarkURL|https://www.liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	And BookmarksFolder add PG
		|folderDescription|Test Folder Description 2|
		|folderName|Test Folder Name 2|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	And Bookmark move To Folder PG
		|bookmarkName|Test Bookmark Name|
		|folderName|Test Folder Name 1|
		|folderName2|Test Folder Name 2|
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	And these variables
		|key_assetName|Test Folder Name 2|
	And AssertClick assert Partial Text Click At the value 'Test Folder Name 2' at locator 'Bookmarks#DESCRIPTIVE_ENTRY_TITLE'
	And these variables
		|key_assetName|Test Bookmark Name|
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Test Bookmark Name' at locator 'Bookmarks#DESCRIPTIVE_ENTRY_TITLE'
