	And BookmarksFolder goto PG
		|folderName|Test Folder Name|
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm|asdf|
	And Search view Search No PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Test Bookmark Name|
		|searchNoResults|true|
		|searchTerm|asdf|
	And Navigator goto Page
